WEBVTT

00:06:56.829 --> 00:07:00.749
Inequality, we're taught to believe,

00:07:00.749 --> 00:07:04.587
was the necessary price of civilization.

00:07:05.713 --> 00:07:09.675
Well, if so, then what are we to make
of the early Middle East?

00:07:09.717 --> 00:07:13.471
Perhaps one might say there was just
a very, very, very long lag time,

00:07:13.512 --> 00:07:15.306
4,000 years,

00:07:15.347 --> 00:07:17.433
before all these developments took place.

00:07:17.433 --> 00:07:20.436
Inequality was bound to happen,
it was bound to set in.

00:07:20.769 --> 00:07:22.438
It was just a matter of time.

00:07:23.189 --> 00:07:26.066
And perhaps the rest
of the story still works

00:07:26.066 --> 00:07:27.860
for other parts of the world.

00:07:29.028 --> 00:07:33.616
Well, let's think a bit about what
we can actually say today